WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 28]

01:43.060 --> 01:43.940
I'm fine.

01:44.860 --> 01:46.520
But I've already told Liu Shao

01:47.420 --> 01:48.020
that

01:48.300 --> 01:50.500
I'm going back to the Immortal Palace with her.

01:50.500 --> 01:51.430
What did you say?

01:54.300 --> 01:56.420
Didn't you say you'd stay a few more days?

01:56.420 --> 01:57.950
But I don't want to anymore.

02:00.980 --> 02:02.780
Did Liu Shao tell you something?

02:03.220 --> 02:03.740
No.

02:05.490 --> 02:07.170
I thought it through.

02:09.660 --> 02:10.500
Maybe

02:11.660 --> 02:12.920
an immortal and a demon

02:13.060 --> 02:14.790
really shouldn't be together.

02:15.420 --> 02:17.660
The old Demon King and Fairy Ze Shui

02:18.500 --> 02:20.260
are our best lesson.

02:21.650 --> 02:22.660
Now that

02:23.100 --> 02:24.900
you have regained your freedom,

02:25.020 --> 02:27.020
stay in the Palace of Aquatic Demons

02:27.020 --> 02:28.550
and be the General of Water.

02:28.900 --> 02:30.780
I'm going back to the Immortal Palace

02:30.780 --> 02:32.370
and be Fairy Luo Ning.

02:33.540 --> 02:34.220
From now on,

02:34.820 --> 02:36.170
we'll go our separate ways

02:36.170 --> 02:37.370
and never meet again.

02:38.100 --> 02:39.160
Isn't that better?

02:39.300 --> 02:40.020
No.

02:41.010 --> 02:41.670
I disagree.

02:42.980 --> 02:43.780
Whatever.

02:44.900 --> 02:45.660
Anyway,

02:45.940 --> 02:48.700
I won't come to the Palace of Aquatic Demons again.

02:48.700 --> 02:51.030
Don't come to the Immortal Palace either.

02:54.540 --> 02:55.260
I said

02:55.980 --> 02:57.020
I disagree.

02:58.500 --> 02:59.700
What do you want then?

03:00.660 --> 03:01.900
You want to learn from the Demon King

03:01.900 --> 03:03.230
and imprison me for life

03:03.820 --> 03:05.240
or just kill me?

03:09.170 --> 03:09.580
No.

03:10.500 --> 03:11.100
I'm sorry.

03:11.890 --> 03:12.490
I'm sorry.

03:23.020 --> 03:23.780
In one night,

03:25.020 --> 03:26.820
Luo Ning was totally different.

03:27.260 --> 03:30.300
It must be Liu Shao.

03:31.380 --> 03:32.700
Why is she leaving all of a sudden?

03:32.700 --> 03:34.540
Luo Ning said she really missed her brother,

03:34.540 --> 03:36.340
so she wanted to go back as soon as possible.

03:36.340 --> 03:38.420
You're worried about Luo Ge too, and want to go back,

03:38.420 --> 03:38.980
right?

03:42.460 --> 03:43.720
In order to be with him,

03:44.500 --> 03:45.730
you can bear any pain.

03:46.860 --> 03:48.860
You can even seal the divine spirit.

03:50.460 --> 03:51.810
You only think of my brother

03:51.810 --> 03:52.810
when you need him.

03:53.460 --> 03:54.340
At other times,

03:54.579 --> 03:55.610
no matter how much he does,

03:55.610 --> 03:56.940
you can't see it, right?

03:57.060 --> 03:57.579
Fu.

03:57.820 --> 03:58.300
What?

03:58.940 --> 04:00.340
Did I say anything wrong?

04:01.060 --> 04:03.790
Do you dare to show her the wound on your right arm?

04:03.900 --> 04:05.030
After all this time,

04:05.300 --> 04:08.560
she still doesn't know that your right arm has been broken.

04:10.060 --> 04:10.530
He Na.

04:12.610 --> 04:13.450
When pacifying demons,

04:13.450 --> 04:15.740
it's inevitable to get hurt when encountering some powerful opponents.

04:15.740 --> 04:17.600
I've already recovered long ago.

04:17.660 --> 04:18.380
No wonder

04:18.620 --> 04:20.500
you've been holding the flute with your left hand.

04:20.500 --> 04:21.360
I was careless.

04:21.540 --> 04:22.019
I'm sorry.

04:22.019 --> 04:23.220
Shouldn't you ask him

04:23.380 --> 04:24.580
how he got injured?

04:25.980 --> 04:27.330
With the power of the Demon King in White,

04:27.330 --> 04:29.100
he can even fight Immortal Feelingless.

04:29.100 --> 04:31.330
Which demon is so powerful as to hurt him?

04:31.330 --> 04:32.020
Enough, Fu.

04:32.500 --> 04:33.180
Why?

04:34.050 --> 04:35.909
When you saved her in the furnace,

04:35.940 --> 04:36.900
has she ever thought about

04:36.900 --> 04:38.460
what it's like for an aquatic demon

04:38.460 --> 04:39.659
to be roasted by fire?

04:40.770 --> 04:42.830
If you were not badly injured inside,

04:43.380 --> 04:44.659
how could a mountain demon

04:44.659 --> 04:45.940
break your arm?

04:50.180 --> 04:51.090
It was an accident.

04:51.090 --> 04:52.220
It's not your fault.

04:53.420 --> 04:53.980
Fu.

04:54.540 --> 04:56.140
What's wrong with you today?

04:59.860 --> 05:00.390
Liu Shao.

05:01.460 --> 05:02.260
Let me ask you.

05:03.660 --> 05:05.300
What did you tell Luo Ning?

05:06.010 --> 05:07.870
Why did she suddenly want to leave

05:08.300 --> 05:09.540
and cut ties with me?

05:11.220 --> 05:12.090
I want to know.

05:12.460 --> 05:13.720
What did you say to her?

05:13.740 --> 05:15.200
Or is it something you did?

05:16.820 --> 05:17.540
I didn't.

05:18.380 --> 05:19.220
And Luo Ning

05:19.220 --> 05:20.090
is the treasure of Luo Ge

05:20.090 --> 05:21.490
and the Immortal Palace.

05:21.540 --> 05:23.620
She is also the heir of Immortal Ze Shui.

05:23.620 --> 05:25.660
Who else can I get back at other than her?

05:25.660 --> 05:27.860
She threw herself at me. She was stupid.

05:28.620 --> 05:30.150
Do you want me to be like you,

05:30.220 --> 05:33.620
someone who can't even keep the woman delivered to your door?

05:36.580 --> 05:37.180
Fu.

05:43.820 --> 05:47.500
The Three-legged Golden Crow and the Crown Wheel are the doppelgangers of the God of the Sun.

05:47.500 --> 05:50.900
They all share the power of the God of the Sun's divine spirit.

05:55.500 --> 05:56.540
I found these too.

06:05.420 --> 06:06.220
He forced us

06:06.220 --> 06:07.580
to read ancient books all night and think of solutions.

06:07.580 --> 06:09.140
But he himself meditated comfortably.

06:09.140 --> 06:10.000
He's an animal.

06:11.180 --> 06:13.620
It seems Master Shang is not afraid of the sealing spell.

06:13.620 --> 06:14.060
Right?

06:14.820 --> 06:15.180
You...

06:15.180 --> 06:16.300
Shut up!

06:17.250 --> 06:19.140
You didn't even check the book closely.

06:19.140 --> 06:20.660
You're just waiting for Liu Shao and Ning

06:20.660 --> 06:22.820
to return to the Immortal Palace to help you, right?

06:22.820 --> 06:24.680
Demon King asked me to come alone.

06:25.450 --> 06:27.250
Do you have something to tell me?

06:28.370 --> 06:29.230
Fairy Luo Ning.

06:30.100 --> 06:31.030
Fu is impetuous.

06:31.420 --> 06:33.180
Sometimes he talks without thinking

06:33.180 --> 06:35.020
and doesn't care about others'feelings.

06:35.020 --> 06:36.100
If he offended you,

06:36.500 --> 06:37.780
please forgive him.

06:38.940 --> 06:40.100
You called me

06:41.180 --> 06:42.380
just to tell me this?

06:44.580 --> 06:45.440
Fairy Luo Ning,

06:46.300 --> 06:47.460
sometimes

06:48.340 --> 06:49.800
Fu talks before he thinks,

06:50.100 --> 06:51.960
but it's not what he really means.

06:52.940 --> 06:53.810
Well said.

06:54.940 --> 06:56.620
To see the nature of a person,

06:57.500 --> 06:58.650
you should not just

06:59.140 --> 07:00.200
observe his deeds.

07:00.300 --> 07:01.300
His words

07:02.020 --> 07:03.080
are important too.

07:04.220 --> 07:04.750
Luo Ning.

07:06.740 --> 07:07.270
Luo Ning.

07:08.060 --> 07:08.920
This is for you.

07:10.980 --> 07:11.420
This

07:12.060 --> 07:14.060
is the same as the one my brother gave to Liu Shao.

07:14.060 --> 07:15.920
I made this out of my demon energy.

07:16.060 --> 07:17.520
You can use it to summon me.

07:18.780 --> 07:19.380
No.

07:20.420 --> 07:22.460
I also put a thread of my spirit into it.

07:22.460 --> 07:23.060
If

07:23.300 --> 07:24.900
I did something wrong to you,

07:25.130 --> 07:26.220
stick needles in it.

07:26.220 --> 07:27.750
It will definitely hurt me.

07:27.940 --> 07:29.420
If you still feel angry,

07:29.820 --> 07:31.020
you can just crush it.

07:31.340 --> 07:32.740
I won't be able to get up.

07:39.210 --> 07:39.670
Really?

07:48.180 --> 07:48.700
Fu.

07:52.420 --> 07:52.980
Fu.

07:54.330 --> 07:54.860
Fu.

07:54.940 --> 07:55.600
Demon King.

07:55.980 --> 07:56.540
Goodbye.

08:04.180 --> 08:04.660
Fu.

08:05.580 --> 08:06.700
What are you doing?

08:13.380 --> 08:14.660
She must've heard

08:15.770 --> 08:16.830
what I said before.

08:18.420 --> 08:19.620
If I don't do this,

08:20.180 --> 08:22.110
she won't be able to vent her anger.

08:22.380 --> 08:23.500
Since you like her,

08:23.700 --> 08:25.860
you should be careful with your words and actions.

08:25.860 --> 08:26.860
Don't you feel sad

08:27.100 --> 08:28.540
when you made her angry?

08:30.180 --> 08:31.020
But look.

08:31.420 --> 08:32.950
She doesn't want me to hurt.

08:34.179 --> 08:35.940
She put my pearl away.

08:37.620 --> 08:39.460
After I left the Immortal Palace,

08:39.460 --> 08:42.659
it's not easy for me to inquire about the Immortal Palace.

08:42.740 --> 08:44.420
If she brings my spirit in,

08:44.900 --> 08:45.740
it's like giving me a chance

08:45.740 --> 08:48.270
to go in and out of the Immortal Palace freely.

08:48.700 --> 08:49.620
Luo Ge is back.

08:49.780 --> 08:51.020
The demon world is unified.

08:51.020 --> 08:53.060
The three worlds are about to live in harmony.

08:53.060 --> 08:54.740
Why do you have to do this?

08:55.820 --> 08:57.780
No matter how harmonious the three worlds are,

08:57.780 --> 08:59.380
we're still living by water.

09:02.780 --> 09:05.240
Are you really afraid of the Immortal Palace

09:07.140 --> 09:09.220
and just want to be a coward?

09:12.580 --> 09:12.980
You...

09:17.100 --> 09:17.660
I'm fine.

09:18.410 --> 09:18.980
Go back.

09:22.540 --> 09:22.980
Okay.

10:01.100 --> 10:04.300
The God of the Sun's Crown Wheel can stop all evil spirits.

10:07.220 --> 10:10.140
That's right. There are many things that the Crown Wheel can do.

10:10.140 --> 10:10.860
I heard that

10:11.180 --> 10:12.540
the Crown Wheel was made by

10:12.540 --> 10:14.820
the God of the Sun with the broken pieces of her divine spirit

10:14.820 --> 10:16.860
and the magic water of the Three-legged Golden Crow.

10:16.860 --> 10:17.820
I heard that...

10:19.460 --> 10:20.390
Liu Shao is back.

10:27.180 --> 10:27.740
Yo.

10:28.060 --> 10:28.790
You're back.

10:29.540 --> 10:30.300
Liu Shao is back.

10:30.300 --> 10:32.460
She didn't come to Palace Chonghua first.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.060
Luo Ge.

10:34.980 --> 10:36.340
You can't beat

10:36.370 --> 10:39.170
Demon King in White who is gentle and considerate.

10:54.140 --> 10:56.800
Is the Tears of the Half-Demon really so useful?

10:56.820 --> 10:58.210
It's useless to me here anyway.

10:58.210 --> 10:58.860
Take it.

11:00.330 --> 11:01.940
Thank you, Luo Ning.

11:03.820 --> 11:05.460
Have you really made up your mind?

11:05.460 --> 11:07.660
Sealing the spirit is no joke.

11:08.500 --> 11:09.300
But...

11:09.420 --> 11:11.540
It's better than us not being together

11:11.540 --> 11:13.940
and hurting each other without knowing it.

11:14.540 --> 11:16.020
Then you'd better seal it.

11:19.180 --> 11:20.090
Remember.

11:20.380 --> 11:21.060
Don't tell your brother

11:21.060 --> 11:22.860
about this.

11:24.340 --> 11:26.260
That's easy for you to say.

11:26.540 --> 11:28.580
How can I hide this?

11:28.690 --> 11:29.380
Look.

11:29.380 --> 11:32.060
We have to pick a date and set up a formation.

11:32.060 --> 11:34.220
We have to ask the masters for help.

11:34.620 --> 11:35.850
Besides,

11:36.260 --> 11:38.860
my brother will find out sooner or later.

11:39.740 --> 11:40.870
Knowing afterwards

11:41.700 --> 11:43.020
and watching me suffer

11:43.300 --> 11:44.760
are two different things.

11:47.460 --> 11:48.500
All right.

11:48.860 --> 11:49.740
As you know,

11:49.900 --> 11:51.740
your brother seems cold

11:51.740 --> 11:53.000
and doesn't talk much,

11:53.060 --> 11:54.790
but he values love and loyalty.

11:55.340 --> 11:56.900
I'm afraid once he knows,

11:57.260 --> 11:58.460
he will blame himself

11:59.060 --> 12:00.420
and suffer every day

12:00.700 --> 12:01.760
before I sealed it.

12:01.860 --> 12:03.860
If he loses his cultivation...

12:06.460 --> 12:07.460
Liu Shao.

12:08.060 --> 12:09.420
My brother is lucky

12:09.820 --> 12:11.100
to have met you.

12:13.340 --> 12:15.740
It's not easy for people who love each other

12:16.380 --> 12:17.340
to be together.

12:18.460 --> 12:19.700
I know

12:20.500 --> 12:22.230
I should cherish my blessings.

12:22.580 --> 12:24.810
You suddenly asked us to read ancient books,

12:24.810 --> 12:25.650
do you want to find a fast way

12:25.650 --> 12:27.050
to ascend to an immortal?

12:28.500 --> 12:30.260
Get everything ready.

12:30.620 --> 12:32.280
I'm doing this to help Liu Shao

12:33.540 --> 12:35.340
cultivate her spiritual power.

13:21.540 --> 13:23.260
You pretended to be so heartless.

13:23.260 --> 13:25.390
Why would you cry with my water energy?

13:28.820 --> 13:30.280
We'll go our separate ways

13:30.380 --> 13:31.580
and never meet again.

13:33.060 --> 13:34.020
You wish!

13:34.860 --> 13:36.120
I won't let you escape.

13:37.700 --> 13:38.960
Give me some more time.

13:39.660 --> 13:40.180
For you,

13:40.700 --> 13:41.420
for my clan,

13:42.570 --> 13:43.900
I have my duties.

13:54.500 --> 13:55.980
You promised to save my junior.

13:55.980 --> 13:57.380
What are you waiting for?

14:01.820 --> 14:02.780
What's the rush?

14:03.540 --> 14:05.140
Leave it to me.

14:07.740 --> 14:09.140
Come out, Fu.

14:09.890 --> 14:11.860
I've suppressed Xie Lingqi.

14:12.980 --> 14:14.900
What is so important that

14:15.460 --> 14:18.060
I have to take such a big risk to get it myself?

14:21.260 --> 14:23.530
A relic of the God of the Moonlight.

14:24.180 --> 14:26.060
I purified and refined it

14:26.100 --> 14:29.230
with my only remaining power of the God of the Moonlight.

14:30.460 --> 14:32.340
The relic of the God of the Moonlight?

14:32.340 --> 14:32.860
Yes.

14:32.940 --> 14:35.500
Do you know it belongs to Xie Lingqi

14:35.700 --> 14:37.700
and it comes from the Yin-yang Cave?

14:39.380 --> 14:40.300
I see.

14:40.900 --> 14:42.140
And you kept using his stuff

14:42.140 --> 14:43.540
again and again.

14:43.900 --> 14:45.900
Luo Ge will find out sooner or later.

14:47.380 --> 14:48.540
Of course I know.

14:49.220 --> 14:51.180
Do you think I'm afraid of him?

14:54.460 --> 14:55.890
You're crazy.

15:02.540 --> 15:03.940
Bone Melting Pool.

15:14.260 --> 15:15.420
Immortal Luo Ge?

15:16.260 --> 15:17.860
Aren't you looking for me?

15:18.140 --> 15:18.900
What?

15:19.140 --> 15:20.200
Are you surprised?

15:22.180 --> 15:24.060
What are you trying to do

15:25.420 --> 15:27.750
by deliberately revealing where you are?

15:31.210 --> 15:32.540
Am I not you?

15:33.530 --> 15:35.620
You don't even know what I want to do?

15:38.620 --> 15:41.950
Your ability to escape is comparable to that of the General,

15:42.020 --> 15:44.450
but don't teach fish to swim in front of me.

15:51.660 --> 15:55.700
I happen to be sick of this body.

16:05.620 --> 16:06.660
How useless.

16:07.340 --> 16:08.900
You can't even protect the medicine.

16:08.900 --> 16:10.500
It's a waste of my time.

16:11.420 --> 16:11.980
Tell me.

16:13.500 --> 16:14.700
Do you know who did it?

16:15.460 --> 16:16.820
I think it was a woman.

16:17.380 --> 16:18.220
A woman?

16:19.940 --> 16:21.940
I smelled the fragrance of flowers.

16:23.330 --> 16:26.140
The thing that took this bottle was cold.

16:27.020 --> 16:28.620
It looks like a drop of water.

16:31.020 --> 16:31.700
Could it be

16:32.700 --> 16:33.620
Luo Ning?

16:39.620 --> 16:40.500
That means

16:40.700 --> 16:42.230
the evil spirit leaked out.

16:42.740 --> 16:44.330
It's hidden

16:44.330 --> 16:45.530
in Xie Lingqi's body.

16:45.900 --> 16:49.020
I've removed the evil spirit in Xie Lingqi's body.

16:49.900 --> 16:51.740
But I suspect there are other evil spirits

16:51.740 --> 16:53.180
in the Immortal Palace.

16:53.700 --> 16:55.260
Speaking of hidden evil spirits,

16:55.260 --> 16:56.780
it must be the Yin-yang Cave

16:56.780 --> 16:58.340
in the Immortal Palace.

17:02.420 --> 17:03.690
Yin-yang Cave?

17:07.980 --> 17:08.700
That place

17:09.060 --> 17:11.420
used to be the place where my father was sealed.

17:11.420 --> 17:14.420
There are a lot of insignificant evil spirits inside.

17:14.619 --> 17:16.660
Since they were sealed by the Protection Spell,

17:16.660 --> 17:18.460
there's nothing to worry about.

17:18.609 --> 17:19.220
But

17:23.460 --> 17:26.190
if the evil spirits in the cave are too turbulent,

17:27.060 --> 17:29.720
they will leak out of the Four Seasons Monument.

17:30.060 --> 17:30.740
Back then,

17:31.210 --> 17:32.820
I was hurt by the evil spirit.

17:40.380 --> 17:42.340
I grasped the Burning Sea 500 years ago.

17:42.340 --> 17:43.100
So what?

17:43.940 --> 17:44.870
That evil spirit

17:45.020 --> 17:46.680
has damaged my immortal root.

17:46.740 --> 17:49.070
If I don't remove it with Xilun Formation,

17:49.220 --> 17:51.140
I will never become an Immortal.

17:55.460 --> 17:56.380
But as you know,

17:56.780 --> 17:57.900
how much it takes

17:58.140 --> 17:59.740
to open the Xilun Formation?

18:01.540 --> 18:02.740
The price is too high.

18:03.620 --> 18:04.620
I can't afford it.

18:05.380 --> 18:06.910
If you had told Zhuo Qiuxian

18:07.340 --> 18:08.700
about this earlier,

18:10.180 --> 18:10.730
I believe

18:11.660 --> 18:14.460
she wouldn't have forced you to cultivate into an Immortal.

18:14.460 --> 18:16.380
But it was my senior's wish for thousands of years

18:16.380 --> 18:18.220
that I cultivate into an Immortal.

18:18.220 --> 18:19.580
If she had to use the Xilun Formation

18:19.580 --> 18:20.780
and sacrifice herself,

18:20.780 --> 18:21.450
by then,

18:21.450 --> 18:22.460
what should I do?

18:24.300 --> 18:25.340
So

18:26.140 --> 18:29.200
you'd rather listen to her nagging and get beaten by her

18:29.340 --> 18:30.740
than tell her?

18:30.940 --> 18:31.740
What can I do?

18:31.740 --> 18:33.060
She is my senior.

18:35.980 --> 18:36.860
Shang Yurong.

18:38.050 --> 18:38.580
Get lost!

18:46.100 --> 18:47.540
That heartless Luo Ge.

18:50.060 --> 18:50.860
Master Shang.

18:51.020 --> 18:52.550
What did Immortal Luo Ge do?

18:52.780 --> 18:54.060
You said he has no conscience again.

18:54.060 --> 18:55.590
It's none of your business.

18:55.900 --> 18:57.570
Look at you, cursing like a shrew.

18:57.570 --> 18:59.630
No wonder Master Zhuo looks so angry.

18:59.980 --> 19:01.500
Don't talk about my senior.

19:01.500 --> 19:01.980
Where is she?

19:01.980 --> 19:02.780
Where is she?

19:18.810 --> 19:19.540
Senior.

19:20.340 --> 19:21.260
Senior.

19:21.540 --> 19:22.700
It's my fault.

19:23.210 --> 19:25.740
I should have been cultivating in the Palace of Abyssal Mirrors.

19:25.740 --> 19:27.260
Luo Ge insisted that

19:27.660 --> 19:29.660
I tell him something about the past.

19:50.500 --> 19:51.020
Senior.

19:51.700 --> 19:52.760
What did I do wrong?

19:53.100 --> 19:54.940
Haven't you grasped the Burning Sea long ago?

19:54.940 --> 19:56.140
Why didn't you use it?

20:00.060 --> 20:00.790
Are you dumb?

20:00.980 --> 20:02.340
Aren't you

20:02.340 --> 20:03.800
usually quite talkative?

20:05.420 --> 20:06.420
Zhuo Qiuxian.

20:07.140 --> 20:07.660
Enough!

20:09.060 --> 20:10.340
This is between Shang Yurong and me.

20:10.340 --> 20:11.620
It's none of your business.

20:11.620 --> 20:13.280
Do you really want to kill him?

20:15.380 --> 20:16.310
Come in and talk.

20:17.740 --> 20:19.060
I made a pot of good tea.

20:33.700 --> 20:36.030
If he wants to cultivate into an Immortal,

20:36.340 --> 20:37.580
he must sacrifice

20:37.580 --> 20:39.580
a General or above.

20:45.020 --> 20:46.750
He can't ascend to an Immortal.

20:48.260 --> 20:51.120
He was also afraid that you would sacrifice for him.

20:52.540 --> 20:54.400
He would rather lie to you forever

20:55.260 --> 20:56.520
and make you resent him

20:57.980 --> 20:59.240
for not going forward.

21:02.260 --> 21:03.660
For the past 1,000 years,

21:04.220 --> 21:06.420
he has been carrying this secret alone.

21:07.660 --> 21:08.660
Even though he is said to be

21:08.660 --> 21:11.460
the most undeserving master of the three palaces,

21:13.900 --> 21:16.160
he just didn't want to sacrifice anyone,

21:17.180 --> 21:17.860
and

21:20.380 --> 21:22.310
he didn't want you to be sad for him.

22:29.300 --> 22:30.540
You knew I would come,

22:31.780 --> 22:33.740
and prepared such a big gift for me.

22:35.930 --> 22:37.990
If I didn't prepare this gift for you,

22:38.740 --> 22:39.660
I wouldn't know

22:40.660 --> 22:42.590
how long you will take me for a fool.

22:43.060 --> 22:44.590
I didn't take you for a fool.

22:45.780 --> 22:46.340
I...

22:47.180 --> 22:47.780
I...

22:50.420 --> 22:52.150
I did hide some things from you.

22:53.300 --> 22:54.960
For example, I saved Bai Feng.

22:55.380 --> 22:57.580
But that's not because I wanted to do it.

22:58.820 --> 23:00.620
It's because she used me before.

23:00.780 --> 23:02.540
And I also saw that she's useful to me.

23:02.540 --> 23:03.580
That's why I saved her.

23:03.580 --> 23:05.540
It's not what you think.

23:05.820 --> 23:06.410
Really?

23:08.090 --> 23:10.020
Bai Feng assassinated the Immortal Master

23:10.020 --> 23:12.220
and almost killed my brother and Liu Shao.

23:12.220 --> 23:13.280
When you saved her,

23:13.500 --> 23:15.230
have you ever thought about me?

23:18.020 --> 23:19.500
That was in the past.

23:20.620 --> 23:21.500
But can you also think about

23:21.500 --> 23:23.140
how good I was to you?

23:23.820 --> 23:24.880
You're shameless!

23:29.260 --> 23:29.790
Luo Ning!

23:31.140 --> 23:31.700
Luo Ning,

23:33.090 --> 23:34.090
don't be mad at me.

23:35.140 --> 23:36.500
If you want to vent your anger,

23:36.500 --> 23:37.420
can you hit me?

23:37.540 --> 23:38.470
Can you scold me?

23:41.860 --> 23:43.500
Stop being hypocritical.

23:44.300 --> 23:45.560
You've been lying to me

23:45.980 --> 23:47.300
from the beginning.

23:47.500 --> 23:48.020
Even...

23:50.380 --> 23:51.660
Even that night.

23:57.500 --> 23:58.140
So,

24:00.020 --> 24:01.580
do you even despise and shun me,

24:01.580 --> 24:03.110
a monster who lives on water

24:03.500 --> 24:05.100
and will die out of it?

24:06.380 --> 24:08.110
You keep showing your weakness

24:10.260 --> 24:11.620
to seek my sympathy.

24:11.620 --> 24:16.160
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

24:12.580 --> 24:14.180
After I revealed your true identity,

24:14.180 --> 24:15.310
it's still the same.

24:16.980 --> 24:17.710
Originally,

24:18.270 --> 24:23.020
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

24:18.420 --> 24:19.970
I didn't want to unmask you.

24:22.100 --> 24:23.360
But what I got in the end

24:23.530 --> 24:29.590
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

24:25.340 --> 24:26.620
is your

24:27.300 --> 24:29.760
water energy pearl full of wicked thoughts.

24:30.590 --> 24:36.570
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

24:30.900 --> 24:31.660
Tell me.

24:32.540 --> 24:33.620
How many times have you

24:33.620 --> 24:36.150
entered the Immortal Palace with this pearl?

24:36.340 --> 24:37.020
I admit

24:38.030 --> 24:42.870
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

24:38.500 --> 24:39.620
I did come here.

24:40.700 --> 24:42.100
But I just came to see you.

24:42.100 --> 24:43.300
I didn't do anything.

24:44.450 --> 24:49.560
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

24:44.740 --> 24:45.460
Fu.

24:47.460 --> 24:49.860
You've been lying to me from the beginning.

24:49.860 --> 24:55.920
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

24:51.940 --> 24:53.940
How can I trust you again?

24:54.740 --> 24:55.740
Or do you

24:56.320 --> 25:03.070
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

24:56.340 --> 24:57.820
think I am stupid?

25:04.820 --> 25:06.340
Take your water energy pearl.

25:06.340 --> 25:09.390
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

25:07.340 --> 25:08.780
Leave now.

25:09.540 --> 25:10.740
From now on,

25:09.550 --> 25:12.340
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

25:11.980 --> 25:13.740
don't ever come here again.

25:12.930 --> 25:15.480
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

25:15.480 --> 25:19.070
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

25:18.460 --> 25:18.990
Luo Ning.

25:19.420 --> 25:22.020
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

25:19.780 --> 25:20.340
Luo Ning.

25:20.340 --> 25:21.020
I beg you.

25:21.380 --> 25:22.220
I beg you.

25:22.020 --> 25:26.450
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

25:22.780 --> 25:24.380
No matter how many mistakes I made,

25:24.380 --> 25:26.310
my love for you has never been fake.

25:26.450 --> 25:33.040
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

25:29.060 --> 25:30.300
I won't give up us.

25:30.500 --> 25:32.300
Nor do I allow you to give up on us.

25:37.580 --> 25:38.220
Please.

25:40.220 --> 25:41.020
Keep this

25:41.260 --> 25:43.020
and let me visit you at the Immortal Palace, okay?

25:43.020 --> 25:44.220
I just want to see you.

25:44.500 --> 25:45.500
Stop dreaming.

25:47.420 --> 25:48.820
Leave now.

25:49.420 --> 25:50.420
Otherwise,

25:50.820 --> 25:52.780
I'll open the Protection Spell in this room

25:52.780 --> 25:54.300
and let someone throw you into the Bone Melting Pool.

25:53.550 --> 25:58.390
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

25:54.540 --> 25:55.740
You wouldn't do that.

25:59.960 --> 26:05.080
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

26:00.780 --> 26:01.420
Indeed.

26:03.540 --> 26:04.460
I wouldn't.

26:05.370 --> 26:11.430
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

26:05.620 --> 26:06.580
You're sure that

26:06.580 --> 26:08.340
my feelings for you are real.

26:10.380 --> 26:11.740
From the beginning,

26:11.840 --> 26:18.580
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

26:12.220 --> 26:13.620
all my feelings for you

26:13.620 --> 26:14.860
was part of your plan,

26:14.860 --> 26:15.740
right?

26:18.220 --> 26:18.900
No.

26:21.850 --> 26:24.900
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

26:25.070 --> 26:27.850
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

26:25.260 --> 26:26.140
Because

26:28.450 --> 26:30.990
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

26:30.990 --> 26:34.580
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

26:34.940 --> 26:37.530
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

26:35.180 --> 26:37.300
I hold you in my palm.

26:37.500 --> 26:39.980
I value you more than my life.

26:37.530 --> 26:41.960
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

26:40.100 --> 26:41.860
You wouldn't be so cruel.

26:41.960 --> 26:48.250
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

26:46.860 --> 26:47.540
Fu.

26:48.250 --> 26:51.560
♫I'm willing to spread my wings♫

26:49.170 --> 26:49.970
You're right.

26:51.560 --> 26:54.690
♫And don't fight the fate♫

26:51.820 --> 26:53.550
I really don't want to hurt you.

26:54.690 --> 27:04.440
♫It's a good moment to share the world with you♫

27:03.260 --> 27:04.460
But I don't want to

27:07.540 --> 27:09.540
see you again for the rest of my life.

27:34.170 --> 27:36.700
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

27:37.490 --> 27:40.600
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

27:40.820 --> 27:43.370
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

27:43.370 --> 27:47.780
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

27:47.780 --> 27:51.130
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

27:51.150 --> 27:54.570
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

27:54.570 --> 28:01.330
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

27:55.940 --> 27:56.740
Fu.

27:59.820 --> 28:01.940
Who hurt your spirit like this?

28:02.580 --> 28:03.710
Is it Fairy Luo Ning?

28:05.700 --> 28:06.620
Mr. Tai.

28:07.940 --> 28:09.800
I'm going to overthrow the world.

28:10.740 --> 28:11.940
I'm going to trap Luo Ning

28:11.940 --> 28:13.670
in the Palace of Aquatic Demons

28:14.500 --> 28:15.630
so that she can never

28:15.660 --> 28:17.460
leave me.

28:18.100 --> 28:18.780
Fu.

28:20.060 --> 28:22.190
But you're no match for Immortal Luo Ge

28:22.620 --> 28:24.170
or His Majesty.

28:29.820 --> 28:30.940
If I...

28:32.380 --> 28:34.840
If I get the demon energy of the Demon King...

28:38.900 --> 28:41.220
The demon energy left by the Demon King

28:41.300 --> 28:43.420
held up the world of Aquatic Demons.

28:44.100 --> 28:45.540
If you get it,

28:46.210 --> 28:48.470
your ability can surpass the Demon King.

28:49.780 --> 28:51.180
But the Aquatic Demons

28:51.820 --> 28:52.330
will...

28:52.820 --> 28:53.880
Do you really think

28:54.660 --> 28:56.460
my brother and I are no match for

28:57.100 --> 28:59.180
the Immortal Palace?

29:01.140 --> 29:04.000
That's just because my brother is kind and refused.

29:04.420 --> 29:04.980
Fu.

29:05.500 --> 29:06.540
Do you mean that

29:08.620 --> 29:09.620
if he refuses...

29:11.540 --> 29:13.620
I'll force him to do it.

29:23.410 --> 29:25.540
Why is she already asleep at this hour?

29:25.820 --> 29:27.660
Fairy has been quite sleepy lately.

29:27.660 --> 29:28.790
Should I wake her up?

29:29.620 --> 29:30.340
No need.

29:30.620 --> 29:32.620
She's been too quiet lately.

29:32.980 --> 29:34.260
I'm worried about her.

29:34.460 --> 29:35.580
Take good care of her

29:35.580 --> 29:36.580
and let her rest.

29:37.660 --> 29:38.220
Also,

29:38.740 --> 29:40.100
I secretly hid some of the homework

29:40.100 --> 29:41.500
her brother gave her.

29:42.420 --> 29:43.170
As for the rest,

29:43.170 --> 29:44.450
let her recite if she can.

29:44.450 --> 29:46.650
If she can't, she can pretend to be sick.

29:46.740 --> 29:47.260
Yes.

29:55.570 --> 29:57.020
You like me so much.

29:57.420 --> 29:58.580
You should be willing to

29:58.580 --> 30:00.860
recite all my homework for this month, right?

29:59.340 --> 30:00.650
[Meditation Spell]

30:02.020 --> 30:02.820
Meditation Spell?

30:02.820 --> 30:05.390
♫This is a spring song♫

30:02.860 --> 30:03.540
What?

30:03.860 --> 30:04.860
You don't want to?

30:04.980 --> 30:05.640
I will do it.

30:06.290 --> 30:07.540
Of course I'll recite for you.

30:06.560 --> 30:09.030
♫The peach blossoms fly with the swallow♫

30:10.130 --> 30:15.230
♫Whose lights are light and shine people's way home?♫

30:15.380 --> 30:16.910
How about I be your brother?

30:17.460 --> 30:18.140
And

30:17.470 --> 30:20.150
♫The clouds roll the sunset♫

30:21.240 --> 30:23.690
♫The moon kisses the eyebrows♫

30:22.340 --> 30:23.690
I want to protect you too.

30:23.690 --> 30:25.920
♫I am waiting for you to say♫

30:24.100 --> 30:26.500
Let you be a happy little fairy.

30:25.920 --> 30:29.940
♫Tonight in this life♫

30:28.180 --> 30:28.710
Luo Ning.

30:29.380 --> 30:30.830
I really appreciate it that

30:30.830 --> 30:34.750
♫Ask the flowing water whether it knows the red leaves♫

30:30.940 --> 30:32.740
I met you in the Immortal Palace.

30:34.750 --> 30:38.330
♫I miss you so much♫

30:37.500 --> 30:39.340
Don't ever come here again.

30:38.330 --> 30:40.810
♫I still remember the youth♫

30:40.100 --> 30:40.630
Luo Ning.

30:41.500 --> 30:42.540
Luo Ning, I beg you.

30:41.560 --> 30:44.910
♫I laughed and hated getting old♫

30:42.900 --> 30:44.540
No matter how many mistakes I made,

30:44.540 --> 30:46.210
my love for you has never been fake.

30:45.690 --> 30:48.510
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

30:46.900 --> 30:49.060
I value you more than my life.

30:48.510 --> 30:50.450
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

30:49.140 --> 30:50.540
You wouldn't be so cruel.

30:50.800 --> 30:53.120
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

30:53.120 --> 30:55.940
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

30:56.270 --> 30:59.410
♫Send you to the Western State♫

30:58.460 --> 31:00.090
What are true?

31:00.550 --> 31:03.310
♫Wild geese pass the mountains and the sea♫

31:01.060 --> 31:02.140
What are fake?

31:03.310 --> 31:05.610
♫I am rushing to a dream♫

31:05.610 --> 31:07.840
♫The fate of three lifetimes♫

31:07.840 --> 31:08.860
♫Appreciate with our hands tied♫

31:08.860 --> 31:14.720
♫Thousands of paths with flowers♫

31:12.060 --> 31:12.780
Fu.

31:13.500 --> 31:15.360
How many times have you lied to me?

31:23.460 --> 31:25.180
Can I still trust you?

31:26.860 --> 31:28.020
Did I give my heart

31:30.020 --> 31:32.840
♫Flowers bloom alone. The fragrance fills the path♫

31:30.140 --> 31:31.740
to the wrong person?

31:32.840 --> 31:34.770
♫Look at the stars from faraway♫

31:35.130 --> 31:37.450
♫The chaos of knowing love♫

31:37.450 --> 31:40.270
♫The South Wind folds a little red♫

31:40.600 --> 31:43.740
♫Send you to the Western State♫

31:44.650 --> 31:46.650
I'm asked to lead the demons to riot.

31:46.940 --> 31:49.000
Will the Aquatic Demons listen to me?

31:49.460 --> 31:51.920
I'll deal with the Palace of Aquatic Demons.

31:51.980 --> 31:53.820
You just need to throw the mortal world into chaos

31:53.820 --> 31:55.480
and wait for my instructions.

31:56.460 --> 31:57.620
Throw the mortal world into chaos?

31:57.620 --> 31:58.700
Is it a safe plan?

32:00.300 --> 32:01.900
I'm afraid the Demon King...

32:02.260 --> 32:03.320
That's different.

32:04.660 --> 32:06.390
I'm not the only one behind you.

32:07.540 --> 32:08.670
There is also the one

32:09.300 --> 32:11.130
who can check and balance Luo Ge.

32:23.860 --> 32:25.060
Cleansing the heart.

32:29.580 --> 32:30.700
Luo Ge.

32:31.500 --> 32:32.980
Do you feel disconcerted?

32:34.020 --> 32:35.540
I am you.

32:36.380 --> 32:38.740
How can you get rid of me?

32:40.180 --> 32:43.060
Even if you can cleanse this small area,

32:44.460 --> 32:45.460
I am

32:46.260 --> 32:49.060
not only here.

32:50.900 --> 32:51.860
Luo Ge.

32:52.180 --> 32:54.780
I'm everywhere in the three worlds.

32:55.620 --> 32:56.820
Go and take a look at

32:57.820 --> 33:01.180
what the people you protect are chasing.

33:02.380 --> 33:03.700
Hypocrisy.

33:05.460 --> 33:06.700
Love and lust.

33:08.860 --> 33:10.170
Obsession.

33:15.100 --> 33:16.420
Greed.

33:19.940 --> 33:21.420
Deception.

33:26.220 --> 33:27.540
Selfishness.

33:31.700 --> 33:33.020
Fight.

33:36.140 --> 33:37.540
Power.

33:39.860 --> 33:41.060
Envy.

33:46.060 --> 33:47.170
Unwillingness.

33:48.260 --> 33:49.500
Prejudice.

33:52.180 --> 33:53.420
Arrogance.

33:56.700 --> 33:58.290
I'm everywhere.

33:59.380 --> 34:01.220
I'm coming.

34:09.260 --> 34:09.920
Be careful.

34:14.940 --> 34:15.540
Who is it?

34:16.659 --> 34:18.590
Who is destroying Aquatic Demons?

34:27.170 --> 34:29.100
[Mansion of Wu Yang Duke]

34:33.940 --> 34:34.449
Hurry.

34:34.820 --> 34:35.460
Hurry!

34:35.699 --> 34:37.830
Ask for help from the Immortal Palace.

34:49.940 --> 34:50.620
No, no.

34:50.940 --> 34:51.670
You can't go.

34:51.940 --> 34:53.070
You really can't go.

34:53.739 --> 34:55.739
Immortal wants you to cultivate in peace.

34:55.739 --> 34:57.060
Do you want me to watch the innocent die?

34:57.060 --> 34:58.500
Immortal Master Wanwu said

34:58.500 --> 35:00.460
he would send the disciples of the Immortal Palace to rescue them.

35:00.460 --> 35:02.020
I'm familiar with the Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

35:02.020 --> 35:03.550
I can help those disciples.

35:03.940 --> 35:04.980
Let me go.

35:09.540 --> 35:10.260
Help!

35:10.260 --> 35:11.590
The ground is cracking.

35:11.620 --> 35:12.380
Help!

35:13.620 --> 35:14.500
Hold on.

35:14.660 --> 35:16.100
Stand firm.

35:17.300 --> 35:19.100
If we're thrown on the water,

35:19.340 --> 35:21.380
we'll all be dead.

35:25.930 --> 35:27.660
His Majesty will save us.

35:28.500 --> 35:29.580
Hold on.

35:29.930 --> 35:32.330
My brother is stabilizing the demon world.

36:09.140 --> 36:10.580
I'll take a look.

36:16.100 --> 36:16.900
Your Majesty,

36:17.210 --> 36:19.460
it was you

36:19.860 --> 36:22.320
who stabilized the demon world by yourself.

36:27.060 --> 36:28.180
Where's Fu?

36:38.920 --> 36:40.430
[Elegant and Graceful]

36:40.020 --> 36:40.740
It's a fairy.

36:40.740 --> 36:42.140
A fairy is here to save us.

36:52.780 --> 36:56.770
[Mansion of Wu Yang Duke]

36:54.380 --> 36:54.940
Liu Shao.

36:55.180 --> 36:56.910
I knew you would come to help us.

36:57.620 --> 36:58.700
Wang Jian, Xue,

36:58.700 --> 36:59.540
are you okay?

36:59.820 --> 37:00.620
We're fine.

37:01.130 --> 37:02.540
It's just that the demons are coming in a fierce manner

37:02.540 --> 37:04.540
and hurting civilians everywhere.

37:04.700 --> 37:05.540
Now,

37:06.060 --> 37:07.740
we are also in fear.

37:08.290 --> 37:09.740
We don't know what to do.

37:11.740 --> 37:12.620
Didn't Immortal Master

37:12.620 --> 37:15.420
send the disciples of the Immortal Palace to help?

37:16.820 --> 37:19.280
Something must have delayed them on the way.

37:19.740 --> 37:21.140
No one else has been here.

37:24.180 --> 37:25.110
What about He Na?

37:25.300 --> 37:26.260
He is the Demon King.

37:26.260 --> 37:27.380
He won't sit by.

37:27.700 --> 37:29.860
We sent someone to the Moon Washing Pond to inform them.

37:29.860 --> 37:31.940
But something happened to the Aquatic Demons too.

37:31.940 --> 37:32.940
No one responded.

37:35.660 --> 37:37.820
Bad things happen in the mortal world and the demon world at the same time.

37:37.820 --> 37:39.020
What are the chances?

37:47.900 --> 37:49.300
Don't worry about

37:49.580 --> 37:50.910
Mansion of Wu Yang Duke.

37:53.300 --> 37:56.030
I've sent disciples to the mortal world to check.

37:57.580 --> 38:00.060
As for the crisis in the demon world,

38:00.580 --> 38:02.060
the Aquatic Demons

38:02.460 --> 38:04.610
always solve their own problems.

38:04.820 --> 38:06.380
Focus on your cultivation.

38:06.460 --> 38:08.300
Don't be disturbed by these problems.

38:08.300 --> 38:10.760
I'll check the Four Seasons Monument later.

38:11.020 --> 38:12.060
You stay here

38:12.300 --> 38:14.020
and continue your cultivation.

38:14.020 --> 38:15.080
It doesn't matter.

38:15.780 --> 38:16.710
I'll go with you.

38:28.020 --> 38:28.620
Liu Shao.

38:29.860 --> 38:31.340
I have a bad feeling.

38:32.060 --> 38:34.540
There seems to be some power surging.

38:35.060 --> 38:36.700
I wonder if anything happened

38:36.700 --> 38:37.780
with He Na.

38:42.650 --> 38:44.310
I've used up all my demon power

38:44.380 --> 38:46.580
to protect the underwater demon world.

38:46.980 --> 38:49.110
Looks like we have to find another way.

39:10.860 --> 39:12.320
Do you admit your mistake?

39:13.260 --> 39:14.580
What did I do wrong?

39:15.060 --> 39:17.060
You stole the demon king's demon energy

39:17.060 --> 39:19.780
and almost destroyed our foundation of ten thousand years.

39:19.780 --> 39:21.710
Foundation of ten thousand years?

39:22.020 --> 39:22.550
Brother.

39:23.100 --> 39:23.960
I really forgot

39:24.450 --> 39:25.910
our foundation is on land.

39:26.260 --> 39:28.250
All the demons had to listen to us.

39:29.090 --> 39:31.460
If we don't break the Four Seasons Monument

39:31.460 --> 39:33.460
and beg the Supreme God to break the curse on our clan,

39:33.460 --> 39:35.920
we will not have the chance to return to land.

39:39.460 --> 39:41.260
Brother, you don't know, do you?

39:41.300 --> 39:43.370
I heard that there's an auspicious sign in the sky.

39:43.370 --> 39:45.460
Luo Ge is about to be deified.

39:46.580 --> 39:47.940
When will you

39:48.140 --> 39:49.340
face the reality?

39:52.460 --> 39:54.540
I asked our clansmen if they would

39:54.980 --> 39:56.900
live like cowards or die fighting.

39:56.900 --> 39:58.700
Listen to our generals' answer.

39:59.300 --> 40:01.980
We are willing to fight to the death.

40:02.260 --> 40:04.060
We don't want to live like cowards.

40:04.060 --> 40:05.850
We will smash the Immortal Palace

40:05.850 --> 40:07.460
and return to land.

40:11.180 --> 40:11.900
Mr. Tai.

40:13.140 --> 40:14.820
Do you think so too?

40:18.180 --> 40:20.500
Your Majesty, please go to the Immortal Palace,

40:20.500 --> 40:21.820
break the Four Seasons Monument,

40:21.820 --> 40:23.460
release the God of the Moonlight,

40:23.460 --> 40:25.120
and lift the curse on our clan!

40:25.460 --> 40:27.660
Release the God of the Moonlight,

40:27.730 --> 40:29.580
and lift the curse on our clan!

40:30.340 --> 40:31.260
Do you know

40:32.130 --> 40:34.330
the one under the Four Seasons Monument

40:34.620 --> 40:36.940
has long been contaminated by evil spirits.

40:36.940 --> 40:39.270
He's no longer a pure God of the Moonlight.

40:39.740 --> 40:41.200
Once he is out in the world,

40:41.370 --> 40:43.170
the three worlds will be in chaos

40:43.620 --> 40:45.660
and all living things will be in misery.

40:45.660 --> 40:47.300
When I was in the Immortal Palace,

40:47.300 --> 40:49.260
the Supreme God once appeared in my dream.

40:49.260 --> 40:50.860
He promised to break the curse

40:50.860 --> 40:52.060
after he's released.

40:52.820 --> 40:53.820
What does the rest

40:54.060 --> 40:55.220
have to do with us?

40:56.420 --> 40:58.380
Your Majesty, please go to the Immortal Palace

40:58.380 --> 40:59.820
break the Four Seasons Monument,

40:59.820 --> 41:01.580
release the God of the Moonlight,

41:01.580 --> 41:03.240
and lift the curse on our clan!

41:03.450 --> 41:05.660
Release the God of the Moonlight,

41:05.860 --> 41:07.700
and lift the curse on our clan!
